{"source": "app_details", "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/api/appdetails?appids=4262460&cc=us&l=english", "collected_at": "2026-11-04T22:13:06Z", "http_status": 200, "payload": {"4262460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ROB RUN", "steam_appid": 4262460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONLY REAL PLAYERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every cop and every criminal is a living breathing human with their own agenda. And with 5,000 players around you, any situation can quickly get out of control. The cops are everywhere, and they pose a real threat. So, if an open fight is too dangerous, you can always find another way to get what you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262460/extras/61abeb20a3a20ba83615a6f47b13cbb6.poster.avif?t=1793811654\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262460/extras/61abeb20a3a20ba83615a6f47b13cbb6.webm?t=1793811654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262460/extras/61abeb20a3a20ba83615a6f47b13cbb6.mp4?t=1793811654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLANS AND POWER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can survive on your own, but you can only thrive by working together. Create your own crime family or join an existing clan. Assign roles, organize raids, take control of territories, wage gang wars, and negotiate truces. In a place where anyone can betray you, reliable allies are your most valuable asset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262460/extras/8664158e9f4ec8fdccca84b17d7d6370.poster.avif?t=1793811654\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262460/extras/8664158e9f4ec8fdccca84b17d7d6370.webm?t=1793811654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262460/extras/8664158e9f4ec8fdccca84b17d7d6370.mp4?t=1793811654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NO ROOM FOR ERROR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You risk losing absolutely everything every minute. Someone can easily take what's yours, but the same is true the other way around. To survive, you have to be able to plan, make quick decisions, and pull the trigger at the right moment.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262460/extras/927da323f734022bb40fe10c8653832e.poster.avif?t=1793811654\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262460/extras/927da323f734022bb40fe10c8653832e.webm?t=1793811654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262460/extras/927da323f734022bb40fe10c8653832e.mp4?t=1793811654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BRUTAL CRIMINAL UNDERWORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bank robberies, raids on rivals' hideouts, police chases, and bloody shootouts. Every day is a struggle for resources and influence. The only things that can get you anywhere are strength and cunning.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262460/extras/16670a122997ba3cba8e16bdd7161c4b.poster.avif?t=1793811654\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262460/extras/16670a122997ba3cba8e16bdd7161c4b.webm?t=1793811654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262460/extras/16670a122997ba3cba8e16bdd7161c4b.mp4?t=1793811654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR HOME IS YOUR CASTLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own hideout. Build and upgrade your base, store loot and vehicles, and place workbenches and safes. But remember: the more lavish your refuge, the more intruders you're going to have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262460/extras/8320e7e90ed978791b61178f8030656c.poster.avif?t=1793811654\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262460/extras/8320e7e90ed978791b61178f8030656c.webm?t=1793811654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262460/extras/8320e7e90ed978791b61178f8030656c.mp4?t=1793811654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TILL THE SERVER WIPES US OUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In just one week, you can go from being a regular thug to the boss of the server's largest organization. And then start over — with new experience, allies, and a more ambitious plan to seize power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262460/extras/f40d1141196b641442842422b0b3a8f9.poster.avif?t=1793811654\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262460/extras/f40d1141196b641442842422b0b3a8f9.webm?t=1793811654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262460/extras/f40d1141196b641442842422b0b3a8f9.mp4?t=1793811654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONLY REAL PLAYERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every cop and every criminal is a living breathing human with their own agenda. And with 5,000 players around you, any situation can quickly get out of control. The cops are everywhere, and they pose a real threat. So, if an open fight is too dangerous, you can always find another way to get what you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262460/extras/61abeb20a3a20ba83615a6f47b13cbb6.poster.avif?t=1793811654\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262460/extras/61abeb20a3a20ba83615a6f47b13cbb6.webm?t=1793811654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262460/extras/61abeb20a3a20ba83615a6f47b13cbb6.mp4?t=1793811654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLANS AND POWER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can survive on your own, but you can only thrive by working together. Create your own crime family or join an existing clan. Assign roles, organize raids, take control of territories, wage gang wars, and negotiate truces. In a place where anyone can betray you, reliable allies are your most valuable asset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262460/extras/8664158e9f4ec8fdccca84b17d7d6370.poster.avif?t=1793811654\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262460/extras/8664158e9f4ec8fdccca84b17d7d6370.webm?t=1793811654\" type=\"vide